  valuePoolDescription:"Profits come from the gap between what clients pay per project or per person and Indian delivery cost; scale, offshore mix and utilisation decide margins. TCS and Infosys earn the highest margins in the group, HCLTech adds software-product income, and Wipro and Tech Mahindra are rebuilding margins. Growth has slowed to low single digits in constant currency: TCS grew 0.5% quarter on quarter in Jul-Sep 2026 and Infosys guided 1-2% for FY27, while large-deal bookings stay strong because clients sign cost-cutting deals.",
