  whyItMatters:"India had 2,117 GCCs with 3,728 units, about 2.36 million employees and $98.4 bn of revenue in FY26, up from $64.6 bn in FY24 (Nasscom-Zinnov, May 2026) - growing faster than the listed services industry. Every new GCC is a customer for office landlords, flexible-office operators, staffing and training firms, and a competitor for the services firms' work and people.",
